WEBVTT

00:03:57.233 --> 00:04:00.820
that is a really beautiful thing
to do for a pumping mother,

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:03.489
because I used to do that in my office.

00:04:03.489 --> 00:04:09.203
I would put my little cooler
that had breast milk amid like

00:04:09.203 --> 00:04:11.622
year-old bottles of salad dressing,

00:04:11.622 --> 00:04:14.333
pad thai that had become petrified,

00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:15.751
just gross stuff.

00:04:16.085 --> 00:04:18.045
And no one should have to do that, right?

00:04:18.045 --> 00:04:19.672
Again, a very, very small thing

00:04:19.672 --> 00:04:21.841
that makes a big difference
in someone’s life.

00:04:21.841 --> 00:04:24.302
In striving to be
as efficient as possible,

00:04:24.302 --> 00:04:25.303
as achieving,

00:04:25.303 --> 00:04:26.595
as productive as possible,

00:04:26.595 --> 00:04:30.182
we’ve drifted away
from this notion of care